        "type": "decided-by"
      },
      {
        "fields": {
          "quote": "Self update SHOULD be a setting. I.E. if I am just a user of Rhiza, I should be able to turn on auto update and get the latest official release. It can also be just set to MAIN, which is what we would want here. For now I understand that main will always be the latest official release, but I will be adding a new release milestone soon that will change that so that the auto update can watch for actual releases and not just new builds.",
          "statement": "Auto-update is a user setting with channels: release (latest official release) and main (Rhiza's VM); main is the latest release until the release milestone adds real releases"
        },
        "handle": "d-auto-update-channels",
        "id": "01M7640C0ZSMG5H5V1R7F3T33W",
